# Dark Sphere (CR 615.1, 615.8, 609.7b, 611.2a): "the next time a source of your choice would deal damage to you this turn,
# prevent half that damage, rounded down". Bot2 Twiddles one Sphere tapped on turn 2: its {T} cost can't be paid, so it can't
# be activated that turn. Bot1 sacrifices the other Sphere at the end of Bot2's turn 2 choosing Bot2's Fencing Ace
# (double strike, 1/1), which deals no damage that turn: "this turn", so it is gone by turn 4. On turn 4 the Ace attacks and
# Bot1 sacrifices the other Sphere choosing it. Its first-strike 1 damage: half of 1, rounded down, is 0 - the shield prevents
# no damage, so it is not used up (CR 609.7b) and Bot1 takes 1. Bot2 then Giant Growths the Ace (4/4): its regular 4 damage
# is the next time, half of it (2) is prevented and Bot1 takes 2: 20 - 1 - 2 = 17. Rounded up, the 1 would have been
# prevented and used the shield up (16); the first Sphere's shield, had it lasted, would have halved the 4 again (18).

